Spec: Owner-confirmed mobile server configuration

Purpose:
  Bind the foreground Agent to a public server identity and fixed control/backend endpoints.

Owns:
  ./ServerSettings.java

Must:
  Accept only a bounded versioned public document containing a specific IPv4 address, distinct control/backend ports and an owner-root-validated server certificate.
  Store atomically in the private no-backup directory after owner confirmation; reject links, malformed or partially present state without falling back to preview.
  Keep configuration immutable during an enabled or starting runtime and expose no Binder configuration method.
  Accept an optional explicitly confirmed STUN endpoint array, defaulting to disabled for existing documents; never add a public fallback implicitly.
